        "message": "UI-R3: integrate wealth review entry and quiet period/icon presentation (v302)\n\nReuse existing grouped review and navigation, hide zero without a container, retain financial/storage semantics. Shared mandatory UI contract covers 0/1/5, seven widths, 200% text, keyboard/Axe and exact bytes/revision."
